<style>
  .panel-root { flex-direction: column; width: 60; padding-top: 2.4; padding-bottom: 2.4; padding-left: 2.8; padding-right: 2.8; background-color: #0b0d12f4; border-color: #4a4b4f; border-width: 0.1; border-radius: 0.5; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 1.2; font-weight: 700; color: #b9b5ab; margin-bottom: 0.5; }
  .title { font-size: 2.1; font-weight: 700; color: #EEE9DF; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .caps { font-size: 1.4; color: #EEE9DF; margin-bottom: 0.8; }
  .chain { font-size: 1.15; color: #b9b5ab; margin-bottom: 0.9; }
  .close { width: 100%; height: 2.8; background-color: #1c2029; border-radius: 0.4; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #EEE9DF; font-size: 1.25; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .gloss { font-size: 1.1; color: #8f8c85; margin-top: 0.2; }
</style>
<div class="panel-root" id="authority-root" style="display: none">
  <span class="eyebrow">ACTOR AUTHORITY - read-only</span>
  <span class="title" id="authority-title">actor</span>
  <span class="caps" id="authority-caps">​</span>
  <span class="chain" id="authority-chain">​</span>
  <button class="close" id="authority-close">Close</button>
  <span class="gloss">a grant is a recorded event with an issuer - capability is not rank, and status is not a verdict on this actor's memories</span>
</div>
